# Execution Plan — Task 145-002-fix

## Problem
timeout-estimator.ts imports TimeoutConfig and DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_CONFIG which don't exist.
ResolvedConfig has no `timeout` field.
config-validator.ts re-exports DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_CONFIG which doesn't exist in config.ts.

## Steps
1. Add TimeoutConfig interface to src/core/config-types.ts
2. Add `timeout?: TimeoutConfig` field to ResolvedConfig
3. Add DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_CONFIG constant to src/core/config.ts
4. Fix TaskRouting interface to include optional timeoutSeconds field (test expects it)
5. Run tsc --noEmit — verify clean
6. Run vitest — verify tests pass
7. Write result file

## Files to modify
- src/core/config-types.ts (add TimeoutConfig, update ResolvedConfig)
- src/core/config.ts (add DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_CONFIG)
- src/orchestra/task-router.ts (add timeoutSeconds to TaskRouting if needed)

## Risk
- Must match the exact shape expected by timeout-estimator.ts and tests
- Must not break existing config merge logic
